				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "n4phA5CdDQC/rbQ7A8ExpA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "After the doozy that is setting up execution, you might think that making a custom snippet type is going to be even more effort. I’ve got good news for you."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-06-11T18:19:51.016989+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:45:39.487355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "Occ9KZCdDQCAEXGwA8ExpA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Creating a snippet type is actually quite simple. Almost all of the code for Carp is in {{gtPackage:Carp|tag=Lepiter}}. The most important class is likely {{gtClass:LeCarpSnippet}}, a subclass of {{gtClass:LeCodeSnippet}}. It gives itself a name for storage (a page saves it as `carpSnippet`), puts itself in the menu of snippet types, and makes a coder."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-06-11T18:25:29.637968+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:45:39.487355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "pS1HPZCdDQCAOUdiA8ExpA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Most of the code you will write will just be specialization over readily-available Lepiter classes: a view model ({{gtClass:LeCarpSnippetViewModel}}) and an element ({{gtClass:LeCarpSnippetElement}}). The one thing that is truly custom is your {{gtClass:GtSourceCoder}}, which for Carp is {{gtClass:GtCarpCoderModel}}. It parses, styles, and evaluates, and it is where the rest of the IDE attaches."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:49:16.267433+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-26T21:49:16.267433+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "zsaKAbpaTp+BCFByRlEOLg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "One thing we have to decide early is which session a snippet evaluates in. In gt4carp, all snippets on a page share one, named after the page ({{gtMethod:LeCarpSnippet>>#newCoder}}). That way a page behaves like a small program that we build up one snippet at a time, which feels just right for a notebook."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2022-06-11T18:28:08.711515+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
